<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's CST H1 net 63.5 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil's CST H1 net 63.5 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian private steelmaker Companhia Siderurgica de Tubarao (CST) issued the following statement on its first half preliminary results.</p>
<p>				H1 1997	  H1 1996</p>
<p>Net profit		  63.5 million	 48.0 million</p>
<p>Operating profit	  92.0 million	 31.6 million</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais, not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
